Subject: [PATCH v2] staging: rtl8723bs: Use min/max macros for variable
 comparison
Message-ID: <Y2OK6fcIkH3S2/1f@qemulion>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: outreachy@lists.linux.dev
